{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Arial;}}\f0\fs28 As a software engineer supporting a fictional release team, I will repair a deployment eligibility query that incorrectly hides valid builds when an exclusion table contains a NULL build ID. In an 18\u8211?22 minute DBeaver workflow, I will inspect the small local tables, demonstrate SQL three-valued logic, choose an explicit policy for unknown IDs, replace the faulty NOT IN predicate with a correlated NOT EXISTS query, and verify exactly which builds the release maintainer can include. The substantive work is SQL correctness and edge-case reasoning in one app; the change is limited to one reporting query.}